    "text": {
      "en": "<h2><tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5327768791654868516\">☕️</tg-emoji> Coffee</h2>\n<p>Espresso from our <b>house blend</b>, roasted every Monday. Oat and almond milk at <i>no extra cost</i>.</p>\n<table compact>\n<tr><th align=\"left\">Drink</th><th align=\"right\">S</th><th align=\"right\">M</th><th align=\"right\">L</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Flat white</td><td align=\"right\">€3.50</td><td align=\"right\">€3.90</td><td align=\"right\">€4.40</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cappuccino</td><td align=\"right\">€3.20</td><td align=\"right\">€3.60</td><td align=\"right\">€4.10</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Iced latte</td><td align=\"right\">—</td><td align=\"right\">€4.20</td><td align=\"right\">€4.70</td></tr>\n</table>\n<tg-button-row><tg-button action=\"flat\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"capp\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"iced\"></tg-button></tg-button-row>\n<p>Can't decide? <tg-button action=\"match\"></tg-button></p>\n<footer>S 250 ml · M 350 ml · L 450 ml. Prices include VAT.</footer>",
      "ru": "<h2><tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5327768791654868516\">☕️</tg-emoji> Кофе</h2>\n<p>Эспрессо из нашего <b>домашнего бленда</b>, обжарка каждый понедельник. Овсяное и миндальное молоко <i>без доплаты</i>.</p>\n<table compact>\n<tr><th align=\"left\">Напиток</th><th align=\"right\">S</th><th align=\"right\">M</th><th align=\"right\">L</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Флэт уайт</td><td align=\"right\">3,50 €</td><td align=\"right\">3,90 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,40 €</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Капучино</td><td align=\"right\">3,20 €</td><td align=\"right\">3,60 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,10 €</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Айс-латте</td><td align=\"right\">—</td><td align=\"right\">4,20 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,70 €</td></tr>\n</table>\n<tg-button-row><tg-button action=\"flat\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"capp\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"iced\"></tg-button></tg-button-row>\n<p>Не можете выбрать? <tg-button action=\"match\"></tg-button></p>\n<footer>S 250 мл · M 350 мл · L 450 мл. Цены с НДС.</footer>",
      "uk": "<h2><tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5327768791654868516\">☕️</tg-emoji> Кава</h2>\n<p>Еспресо з нашого <b>домашнього бленду</b>, обсмажуємо щопонеділка. Вівсяне й мигдальне молоко <i>без доплати</i>.</p>\n<table compact>\n<tr><th align=\"left\">Напій</th><th align=\"right\">S</th><th align=\"right\">M</th><th align=\"right\">L</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Флет вайт</td><td align=\"right\">3,50 €</td><td align=\"right\">3,90 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,40 €</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Капучино</td><td align=\"right\">3,20 €</td><td align=\"right\">3,60 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,10 €</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Айс-лате</td><td align=\"right\">—</td><td align=\"right\">4,20 €</td><td align=\"right\">4,70 €</td></tr>\n</table>\n<tg-button-row><tg-button action=\"flat\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"capp\"></tg-button><tg-button action=\"iced\"></tg-button></tg-button-row>\n<p>Не можете обрати? <tg-button action=\"match\"></tg-button></p>\n<footer>S 250 мл · M 350 мл · L 450 мл. Ціни з ПДВ.</footer>"
